            "review_title": "Review at Dogalbi Saigon",
            "review_text": "Nguyệt Vy\n1 contribution\n0\nExcellent Dogalbi Experience\nApr 2025 • Solo\nRecommended to all of you 🥰\nWagyu is fresh, clean and very juicy.\nThe spicy pork is amazing, the steamed eggs, kimchi soup and cold noodles are perfect. I wish I had an empty stomach so I could eat all the dishes of this restaurant. Reasonable price. Cute and enthusiastic staff. So great! 🤭\nWritten April 25, 2025",
