            "review_title": "Review at Dogalbi Saigon",
            "review_text": "Phú\n2 contributions\n0\nGreat Korean restaurant in the of Hochiminh City !\nMar 2025 • Solo\nWe visited the restaurant in the of March, 2025.\nFood was delicious. We really enjoyed our dinner here. We ordered salad with tuna and egg, spicy glass noodles, 2 sets of beef BBQ and they were all tasty and delicious. Food on the side were great as well, with sweet potato, sweet and sour mango and cucumber...In addition, its chilli sauce was also nice.\n\nStaffs in this restaurant were very nice, friendly, helpful and enthusiastic. The manager in black uniform was excellent also. He took care of us very carefully with his enthusiasm !\n\nI would recommend this restaurant for tourist who want to enjoy Korean food in Hochiminh city !\n\nP/s: Just one little thing to restaurant staffs: It would be perfect if our beautiful ladies and gentlemen smile as much as possible !👍🏼👍🏼👍🏼\nRead more\nWritten March 6, 2025",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-05",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
